anio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2895701616.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2895701615.webp\"]","descs":"孤儿海蒂（阿努克·斯特芬 饰）被姨母迪蒂（安娜·希恩斯 饰）送上了阿尔卑斯山，与远离小镇独居于高山的祖父（布鲁诺·甘茨 饰）一同生活。活泼的海蒂在这里如鱼得水，不仅收获了羊倌彼得（奎林·阿格里皮 饰）的友情和孤僻祖父的亲情，还与山下彼得的家人打成一片。一天，海蒂同彼得在山上放羊，姨母突然出现，连哄带骗将海蒂卖到法兰克福的泽塞曼家。从此，目不识丁的海蒂成为了小姐克拉拉（伊莎贝尔·奥特曼 饰）的伴读。克拉拉幼年丧母，大病一场再不能站立，只能被困在豪宅中与轮椅相伴。父亲（马克西姆·梅米特 饰）常年在外很少回家，寂寞的克拉拉把海蒂当成了救命稻草。海蒂能适应泽塞曼家的新生活吗？远在天边的祖父和彼得还能再见吗？克拉拉的腿还有好起来的希望吗？ ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1waUIgsLyyfYjbrrsUKyv7A?pwd=b9ru\",\"size\":\"1.68\",\"date\":\"2025-08-07\",\"type\":5,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":124,"title":"少年派的奇幻漂流 Life of Pi","ratingNum":9.1,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 99% 剧情片\n好于 99% 奇幻片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p1784592701.webp","tag":"No.45豆瓣电影Top250","address":" 美国 / 中国台湾 / 英国 / 加拿大","years":"2012","date":"2012-11-22(中国大陆)、2012-09-28(纽约电影节)、2012-11-21(美国)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1785901007.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1784571177.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1785896200.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1791597034.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1784581313.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1784592701.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1769649282.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1793391391.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1784590225.webp\"]","descs":"　故事开始于蒙特娄，也结束于蒙特娄。一名在找寻灵感的作家（拉菲·斯波 Rafe Spall 饰）无意间得知派·帕帖尔（伊尔凡·可汗 Irrfan Khan 饰）的传奇故事。派的父亲（阿迪勒·侯赛因 Adil Hussain 饰）开了一家动物园。因这样特殊的生活环境，少年派（苏拉·沙玛 Suraj Sharma 饰 ）对信仰与人的本性自有一套看法。","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1GGeAApQzfh88vdQbjLIj5A?pwd=ru54\",\"size\":\"\",\"date\":\"2025-08-24\",\"type\":5,\"isZn\":0}]"},{"id":1251,"title":"冰川时代3 Ice Age: Dawn of the Dinosaurs","ratingNum":8.3,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 96% 喜剧片\n好于 93% 动画片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2213132432.webp","tag":"喜剧,动画,冒险","address":" 美国","years":"2009","date":"2009-07-08(中国大陆)、2009-07-01(美国)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2100252532.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p443418169.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p443418117.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p443418240.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2100243221.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2213132432.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1769866928.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1852941653.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p773526018.webp\"]","descs":"一群老朋友又将开始一段新的旅程。当猛犸象曼尼（Manny）沉浸在马上要当爸爸的喜悦之时，剑齿虎迭戈（Diego）却为自己的逐渐衰老而黯然伤神，此时树懒希德（Sid）则发现了三枚恐龙蛋，居然“母爱”泛滥，想做这三只小霸王龙的妈妈，结果被小恐龙真正的妈妈霸王龙掳走。\n　　为了寻 找同伴，一群可爱的动物朋友们走进了隐藏在冰河世纪之下的“侏罗纪公园”，在这片神奇的地方，他们会认识什么新朋友，又会遭遇到什么危险，这都让所有众多“冰粉”们充满期待。\n　　这部电影作为20世纪福克斯公司（20th Century Fox）第一部3D形式大规模上映的动画片其制作成本达到1.2亿美元，几乎是《冰河世纪1》的两倍。 ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1MYXDZrixYrcr06azluOUew?pwd=udnr\",\"size\":\"1.8\",\"date\":\"2025-08-11\",\"type\":4,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":1250,"title":"冰川时代2 Ice Age: The Meltdown","ratingNum":8.2,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 96% 喜剧片\n好于 92% 动画片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p465649801.webp","tag":"喜剧,动画,冒险","address":" 美国","years":"2006","date":"2006-06-09(中国大陆)、2014-10-13(中国大陆 3D)、2006-03-31(美国)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2204956246.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2200367106.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2189814358.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2204956248.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2189814361.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2204578670.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2204581492.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1966988179.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p595019272.webp\"]","descs":"地球上的冰河期终于就快要结束了！面对一天天变暖的天气，动物们都欢欣鼓舞。万物回春的天气里，食物多种多样，生活无忧无虑……\n　　我们第一集的三个英雄迭戈（剑齿虎）、曼尼（猛犸）和希德（树獭）却在普世欢腾的气氛中察觉出了危机：随着地球逐渐变暖，水位正慢慢上升，照这个速度下去，动物们的家园很快将被淹没。\n　　于是，动物们在迭戈、曼尼和希德的带领下，又开始了找寻新家园的旅途。路上，除了欢笑连连，还有苦难多多。动物们最终能否克服困难，找到一个全新的天地？ ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1MYXDZrixYrcr06azluOUew?pwd=udnr\",\"size\":\"1.58\",\"date\":\"2025-08-11\",\"type\":5,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":1252,"title":"冰川时代4 Ice Age: Continental Drift","ratingNum":8.1,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 95% 喜剧片\n好于 91% 动画片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p1634625172.webp","tag":"喜剧,动画,冒险","address":" 美国","years":"2012","date":"2012-07-27(中国大陆)、2012-06-27(法国)、2012-07-13(美国)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1597979230.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1597977067.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1460725857.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1460723164.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1597978401.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1596241117.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1634625172.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1630982450.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2264866050.webp\"]","descs":"Chris Wedge\n　　《冰川时代4》讲述的依然是那些生活在冰川时期的特殊动物“家庭”经历的冒险故事。那只永远追着松果的无敌贱，又苦逼的小松鼠奎特（克里斯·韦奇 Chris Wedge 配音 ）这次搞出了更大的事件，一个不小心让大陆板块四分五裂，使得猛犸象曼尼（雷·罗马诺 Ray Roman o 配音）、树懒希德（约翰·雷吉扎莫 John Leguizamo 配音）以及剑齿虎迪亚哥（丹尼斯·利瑞 Denis Leary 配音）因此和家人、伙伴失散分离，在板块激烈的运动并分裂漂移后，只能使用一块流冰作为临时的船只，展开一段惊奇的海上大冒险，在海上他们会遭遇险恶的自然环境，也会遇到海盗，而回家与家人团聚是他们的终极愿望，他们最后能否顺利回家呢？ ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1MYXDZrixYrcr06azluOUew?pwd=udnr\",\"size\":\"1.6\",\"date\":\"2025-08-11\",\"type\":0,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":1245,"title":"金刚 King Kong","ratingNum":8,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 95% 动作片\n好于 93% 奇幻片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p858079649.webp","tag":"第78届奥斯卡金像奖获奖名单","address":" 新西兰 / 美国 / 德国","years":"2005","date":"2006-01-12(中国大陆)、2005-12-05(纽约首映)、2005-12-14(美国)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p459569895.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2057259438.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p459571565.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p459573304.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2057259610.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p858079649.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2177130090.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2885736824.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1340633047.webp\"]","descs":"导演率领拍摄组来到神秘的骷髅岛开始了一部电影的拍摄，女主角是漂亮娇小的安(娜奥米•沃茨 Naomi Watts 饰)，她在纽约的演艺事业陷入了低谷，这是她时来运转的大好机会。他们乘坐轮船来到岛上，却不知在岛上即将要险象横生。\n　　正当导演要开始开机拍摄时，他们遭到了当地土著的袭击，几个随行人员遇难身亡。摄制组慌忙逃离，幸好起航离去，却发现不见了女主角安。\n　　原来安土著野人抓走，被当作祭品。安尖声惊叫，引来了传说中骷髅岛的猩猩——金刚的关注。金刚在岛上很有霸气，连恐龙都要忌它几分。然而，野兽爱上了美人，金刚搭救安脱离困境，不料却让自己陷入了一场悲剧。 ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1bpyXEsxOW7ksmwvqbKKSpQ?pwd=4gs9\",\"size\":\"2.6\",\"date\":\"2025-08-10\",\"type\":4,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":1212,"title":"变形金刚：起源 Transformers One","ratingNum":7.9,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 91% 动作片\n好于 92% 科幻片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2912407834.webp","tag":"No.4|近期热门动画片榜","address":" 美国","years":"2024","date":"2024-09-27(中国大陆)、2024-09-07(澳大利亚)、2024-09-20(美国)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2913448717.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2913293650.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2913448715.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2912429420.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2913448716.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2912407834.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2912155099.webp\"]","descs":"故事发生在变形金刚的母星塞伯坦，聚焦变形金刚的青年时代，讲述汽车人领袖擎天柱（克里斯·海姆斯沃斯 Chris Hemsworth 配音）与霸天虎领袖威震天（布莱恩·泰里·亨利 Brian Tyree Henry 配音）从手足走向反目的故事，打响旷日持久的塞伯坦之战。","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1QZj20reM99VWJtU0cBdlbQ?pwd=6ysq\",\"size\":\"\",\"date\":\"2025-08-07\",\"type\":4,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":1240,"title":"恐龙 Dinosaur","ratingNum":7.7,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 77% 动画片\n好于 81% 冒险片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p1006533162.webp","tag":"动画,冒险","address":" 美国","years":"2000","date":"2000-05-19(美国)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2503833748.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2503833768.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2153549223.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2503833754.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2503833733.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1006533162.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2197696691.webp\"]","descs":"小禽龙阿拉达生活在白垩纪晚期，他自小就生活在一个桃花园般的小岛上。由一群狐猴抚养长大大的阿拉达从来就没有见过自己的同类，与他的狐猴朋友一直无忧无虑的生活在一起。一场不期而至的流星雨将阿拉达所在的小岛击毁了，阿拉达和他的狐猴朋友一起逃难来到了大陆。这时，因为大气变热，水源供给越来越紧张，阿拉达他们遇上了一群正在迁徙寻找新的栖身之地的恐龙并加入了他们。于是，阿拉达和同伴们一起开始了这次异常艰难的迁徙之旅。 ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1J6r-bmnu9rfVYzICnMVw8g?pwd=4gs9\",\"size\":\"0.85\",\"date\":\"2025-08-10\",\"type\":5,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":1253,"title":"冰川时代5：星际碰撞 Ice Age: Collision Course","ratingNum":7.3,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 86% 喜剧片\n好于 78% 动画片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2365220825.webp","tag":"喜剧,动画,冒险","address":" 美国","years":"2016","date":"2016-08-23(中国大陆)、2016-07-22(美国)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2316390643.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2316390620.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2374758998.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2349934497.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2295960272.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2360710653.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2365828620.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2886537280.webp\"]","descs":"影片讲述松鼠奎特（克里斯·韦奇 Chris Wedge 配音）为了追松果，偶然引发了宇宙事件，改变并威胁着冰川时代的世界。为了拯救自己，话唠树懒希德（约翰·雷吉扎莫 John Leguizamo 配音）、猛犸象曼尼（雷·罗马诺 Ray Romano 配音）、剑齿虎迪亚哥（丹尼斯·利瑞 Denis Leary 配音），以及别的动物群族必须离开家园，踏上了他们充满喜剧色彩的冒险旅程，他们来到了充满异国情调的新大陆，并遇到了许多形形色色的新角色。","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1MYXDZrixYrcr06azluOUew?pwd=udnr\",\"size\":\"1.73\",\"date\":\"2025-08-11\",\"type\":4,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":1229,"title":"遗落战境 Oblivion","ratingNum":7.1,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 84% 动作片\n好于 84% 科幻片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p1870772842.webp","tag":"动作,科幻,冒险","address":" 美国","years":"2013","date":"2013-05-10(中国大陆)、2013-04-19(美国)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1932083746.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1924654679.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1945971727.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1807000115.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1924654578.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1870772842.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2176865108.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1806250025.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1887183554.webp\"]","descs":"2017年，母星遭到毁灭的外星流亡者入侵地球。人类虽然用核武器打败对手，但也付出失去家园的惨痛代价。在接下来将近半个世纪的时光中，人类移民泰坦星（土卫六），不过仍有极少部分人类留在故土，扫荡残存的外星掠夺者。杰克·哈珀（汤姆·克鲁斯 Tom Cruise 饰）与维多利亚（安德丽亚·瑞斯波罗格 Andrea Riseborough 饰）即是留守者中的一员，他们的主要任务为保障遍布各地守护水萃取塔的无人机正常运行。看似永无止境的任务终于接近尾声，而就在此刻，不明飞行器坠落一处无人区。杰克在当地发现数名人类伤员，可是他们却遭到无人机的屠杀。危急时刻，杰克救下了一个名为茱莉亚（欧嘉·柯瑞兰寇 Olga Kurylenko 饰）的女子。\n　　这一事件令杰克无意中知晓了掠夺者以及自身背后隐藏的秘密…… ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1sDo8q6cHPn4BwAw_4NSY1w?pwd=hk2h\",\"size\":\"1.52\",\"date\":\"2025-08-08\",\"type\":5,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":1244,"title":"地心历险记 Journey to the Center of the Earth","ratingNum":6.9,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 80% 动作片\n好于 80% 科幻片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p453461145.webp","tag":"动作,科幻,冒险","address":" 美国","years":"2008","date":"2008-09-29(中国大陆)、2008-07-11(美国)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p456695395.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p456694197.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p456695306.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p456694119.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2702545711.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p453461145.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2243705955.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2907366156.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2907366152.webp\"]","descs":"虽然特雷弗（布兰登·费舍 Brendan Fraser 饰）是大学的地质教授，但是却经常做出挑战传统的事情。他认为，凡尔纳的小说并不是科幻，而是真是存在的。就是因为这样的对立理论，使其被传为学院里的笑话，使得他的学术名声毁于一旦。不过特雷弗却毫不在意这些，他坚信自己的理 论是正确的。为了验证自己的理论，特雷弗带着侄子肖恩（乔什·哈切森 Josh Hutcherson 饰）和当地的向导汉娜（安妮塔·布瑞姆 Anita Briem 饰）开始了在冰岛的旅行。在旅行时，三人意外发现一个奇特的洞穴，并在探询时踏破薄冰跌入了无底深渊。不过，当他们醒来时，却发现了一个神秘的地心世界，里面有着各种稀奇古怪的生物，与凡尔纳小说里面描述的场景一模一样。证据终于找到了，但是如何将证据带回地上？特雷弗三人开始了寻找出路之旅…… ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1dZ5-CifZN9SuVceeZrUu6g?pwd=4gs9\",\"size\":\"1.26\",\"date\":\"2025-08-10\",\"type\":5,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":1259,"title":"前往希腊剧院 Get Him to the Greek","ratingNum":6.8,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 68% 喜剧片\n好于 65% 冒险片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?ur