s://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2446137936.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2436030518.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2425188737.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2455521475.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2455521466.webp\"]","descs":"上世纪70年代，一支集结了科考队员、探险家、战地摄影记者、军人的探险队，冒险前往南太平洋上的神秘岛屿——骷髅岛。他们的到来惊扰了岛上之神——史上最大金刚。经过一番惨烈的激战之后，探险队员散落在了岛屿各处。此时，队员们才意识到这次探险并不是一次单纯的科考任务，而是去探索怪兽存在的证明。\n　　在这片与世隔绝、危险密布的丛林，无数怪异的史前生物暗藏其中，时刻威胁着他们的生命。队员们还遇到了神秘的原始部落，金刚的身世和其守护岛屿的原因也被逐渐揭开，原来，恐怖阴森的骷髅岛上还蛰伏着更凶狠残暴的怪兽……","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1ZWkqovUZzKH0jfpJiH5xRg?pwd=4gs9\",\"size\":\"1.68\",\"date\":\"2025-08-10\",\"type\":4,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":1213,"title":"掠食城市 Mortal Engines","ratingNum":6.3,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 70% 动作片\n好于 71% 科幻片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2543972440.webp","tag":"第17届美国视觉效果协会奖获奖名单","address":" 美国 / 新西兰 / 日本","years":"2018","date":"2019-01-18(中国大陆)、2018-12-14(美国)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2508144767.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2511270103.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2565386216.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2508105552.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2524136409.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2545488791.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2541570446.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2528758251.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2549962116.webp\"]","descs":"一次灾难性事件毁灭了文明，数千年后，人类已经适应，并进化出了新的生存方式。如今，巨大的移动城市在地球上漫步，无情地吞噬着小牵引城镇。汤姆·纳茨沃西（罗伯特·席安饰），来自大牵引城市伦敦的低层，在遭遇了危险逃犯海特·肖（海拉·希尔莫饰）后，不得不开始为生存而奋战。两个截然相反，本不该相遇的人，却意外结盟，他们注定将改变未来。","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1CvzUFulgGA8N3So4ApiRJw?pwd=6ysq\",\"size\":\"\",\"date\":\"2025-08-07\",\"type\":5,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":1230,"title":"异界 Кома","ratingNum":6.2,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 62% 动作片\n好于 65% 科幻片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2581658698.webp","tag":"动作,科幻,冒险","address":" 俄罗斯","years":"2020","date":"2020-01-30(俄罗斯)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2526992822.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2542786557.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2542786556.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2573607898.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2526992825.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2581658698.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2577699733.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2613737731.webp\"]","descs":"诡异奇幻的世界，充满了一切不可能。建筑师维克托（林奈·穆罕默托夫 Rinal Muchametow 饰）从沉沉的梦中醒来，仿佛失去了所有的记忆。此时此刻，房屋上下充满了霉变一般的黑斑，而黑斑就像有生命一般，时而扩张，时而退缩。维克托走出房门，来到大街，发现眼前的一切早已脱离了现实，房屋从各个角度耸立，身边的人残缺不全却行走如常。正在此时，一团如沸腾沥青般的怪物细想了他，关键时刻维克托被二男一女救下。事后从对方口中得知，服药过量或者因事故处于濒死状态的人，才会来到这片由同类们的大脑共同构建的潜意识的世界。\n　　为了生存，维克托必须想方设法激发自己潜在的能力…… ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/14M1ULCF3-Vgn_VYnUzg5HA?pwd=hk2h\",\"size\":\"1.51\",\"date\":\"2025-08-08\",\"type\":5,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":1260,"title":"女王神剑 Red Sonja","ratingNum":5.7,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 14% 奇幻片\n好于 11% 冒险片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2528455